hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28198","Hisham ibn Said narrated to us, he said: Muawiyah ibn Sallam informed us, he said: I heard Yahya ibn Abi Kathir, he said: Bajjah ibn Abdillah informed me that his father informed him that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to them one day: This is the day of Ashura, so fast. A man of Banu Amr ibn Awf said: O Messenger of Allah, I left my people, some of them fasting and some of them breaking fast. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Go to them, whoever of them was breaking fast, let him complete his fast."
